---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="HIPAA-Compliant Website Forms" description="HIPAA-compliant website intake forms for dental practices. Capture patient information safely without exposing PHI.">

  <section class="bg-gray-50 py-16 lg:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
        <div>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center bg-brand-teal/10 text-brand-teal text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-6">Secure Infrastructure</span>
          <h1 class="font-display text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-semibold text-brand-dark leading-tight mb-6">
            HIPAA-Compliant<br />Website Forms for<br /><em class="font-display italic font-normal">Dentists.</em>
          </h1>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-base leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-md">
            Secure patient data intake with military-grade encryption. We provide clinical-level protection for your digital front door, ensuring every patient submission meets federal standards without sacrificing user experience.
          </p>
          <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-brand-slate hover:bg-brand-dark text-white font-semibold text-sm px-6 py-3 rounded-md transition-colors">
            Contact Us to Learn More &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="aspect-[4/3] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-gray-200">
            <img src="/hero-website-forms.jpg" alt="HIPAA-compliant website forms" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">

        <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          <p class="text-lg">Most dental website contact forms are not HIPAA compliant. If a prospective patient submits their information — including their name, phone number, and reason for calling — that data constitutes PHI and must be handled accordingly.</p>
          <p>Our HIPAA-compliant website forms are built to capture patient intake information safely, with proper data handling, BAA coverage, and secure transmission.</p>

          <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-7 border border-gray-100 space-y-4">
            <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-700 text-brand-dark">Form Pricing</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Our forms are priced affordably for practices of all sizes. Contact us for current pricing and to discuss your specific needs.</p>
            <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-brand-red text-sm font-semibold hover:text-red-700 transition-colors">
              Get a quote →
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-7 border border-gray-100 space-y-4">
            <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-700 text-brand-dark">What's Included</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              {[
                'HIPAA-compliant form hosting and submission handling',
                'Business Associate Agreement (BAA) included',
                'Secure encrypted data transmission',
                'Integration with your existing website',
                'Email notifications for new submissions',
                'Optional CRM integration',
              ].map(item => (
                <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-teal shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                  {item}
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>

          <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-brand-red hover:bg-red-600 text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-full transition-colors text-sm">
            Get Started
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-brand-slate rounded-2xl p-8 text-white">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-700 mb-4">Is Your Current Form HIPAA Compliant?</h3>
          <p class="text-white/70 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">Most standard contact forms — including those built into popular WordPress themes and page builders — are not HIPAA compliant. Common issues include:</p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8">
            {[
              'Form data stored in unencrypted WordPress database',
              'Notification emails sent via non-BAA email providers',
              'Third-party plugins without BAA coverage',
              'No audit logging of data access',
            ].map(item => (
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-white/70">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-red shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                {item}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white text-brand-slate font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-sm hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors">
            Fix This For My Practice
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
